{"abstract":"The Department of Commerce (Commerce) published a notice in the Federal Register on February 8, 2022, in which Commerce announced the final results of the 2019-2020 administrative review of the antidumping duty order on steel concrete reinforcing bar from the Republic of Turkey. This notice corrects the Assessment Rates section to include a sentence regarding Colakoglu Metalurji A.S./Colakoglu Dis Ticaret A.S.'s (Colakoglu) liquidation instructions that was inadvertently omitted.","action":null,"agencies":[{"id":54,"json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/agencies/54","name":"Commerce Department","parent_id":null,"raw_name":"DEPARTMENT OF COMMERCE","slug":"commerce-department","url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/agencies/commerce-department"},{"id":261,"json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/agencies/261","name":"International Trade Administration","parent_id":54,"raw_name":"International Trade Administration","slug":"international-trade-administration","url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/agencies/international-trade-administration"}],"body_html_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/html/2022/04/01/2022-06866.html","cfr_references":[],"citation":"87 FR 19073","comment_url":null,"comments_close_on":null,"correction_of":null,"corrections":[],"dates":"Applicable April 1, 2022.","disposition_notes":null,"docket_ids":["A-489-829"],"dockets":[],"document_number":"2022-06866","effective_on":null,"end_page":19074,"executive_order_notes":null,"executive_order_number":null,"full_text_xml_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/xml/2022/04/01/2022-06866.xml","html_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2022/04/01/2022-06866/steel-concrete-reinforcing-bar-from-the-republic-of-turkey-final-results-of-antidumping-duty","images":{},"images_metadata":{},"json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/documents/2022-06866?publication_date=2022-04-01","mods_url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/metadata